<gpx version="1.1" creator="Good Shit" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><trk><name>Klíč circuit — Klíč circuit [planning only — not navigation-grade]</name><desc>From Nový Bor square follow red to the Klíč summit spur, ascend and return to the same junction, then continue on red to Sedlo pod Klíčem. Take blue to its green junction and follow green back to Nový Bor square.

Stay on marked protected-area paths. The upper ascent is steep and exposed; leaves, ice and wind can make footing hazardous. Off-path scree and climbing are outside this walking course. Follow the marked town walking route and current local restrictions, and check signs and conditions before walking.

Allow approximately 240 minutes for 11.1 km, with inherited approximate ascent and descent estimates of 500 m each; these are not surveyed elevation figures. Geometry uses the complete current captured OpenStreetMap API XML paths from four actual tiles (© OpenStreetMap contributors, ODbL 1.0). This is a descriptive planning route, not navigation-grade, with no elevation data.

